{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　　夏の終わりが近づいていますね…\n近づいているのか?笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日が短くなっていることは感じています🎐🍃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私はここ数週間、頭の中が阿波おどりでいっぱいでした😮"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨夜、櫻坂チャンネルで公開されました「【阿波おどり】冬優花が娯茶平で踊って！踊りまくる！【徳島】」で、ずーっと行ってみたかった阿波おどりの本場徳島へ行き、阿波おどりを踊ってきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"📌 https://youtu.be/a7bbhKlbDDA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05M9VJBATF3B20NWZ63DK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徳島県で阿波おどりを踊れる日が来るとは思っていなかったので、本当に嬉しかったです…!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05NCJMPXECVWP2E4NRC2S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんと今回、徳島県の「娯茶平」の皆様と一緒に踊らせていただきました😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"阿波おどりに詳しくない方もいらっしゃると思いますので軽く説明いたしますと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"阿波おどりは「連」と呼ばれるいくつかのグループに分かれています!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中で私は過去に東京の「飛鳥連」に所属していました👘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その「飛鳥連」は、今回参加させていただいた徳島の「娯茶平」の姉妹連です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって、本場徳島の阿波おどりと言ったら娯茶平さん、というくらい小学生の時から憧れの存在でした✨✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、今回本当に本当に嬉しくて、でも一緒に踊らせていただいて良いのか不安で、当日まで緊張で爆発しそうでした🤯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私を娯茶平の皆さんは温かく迎えてくださり、ガチガチだった私の心と表情が、踊れば踊るほど和らいでいきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05PFWZ7GJKHWF31BKPVAW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"娯茶平のモモの皆さんと💟"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際に踊ったら、阿波おどりの楽しさを思い出して、このままずっと踊っていたいと思ってしまうほど夢のような時間でした💭💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05QJPGDJW5FNNFFWZHF0N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊った後は、山名連長がご飯屋さんに連れて行ってくださり、徳島の郷土料理や名産品をご馳走してくださいました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いただいたご飯も全て美味しかったですし、皆さんの優しさもあり徳島県が大好きになりました😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の大好きなさつまいもの「なると金時」も有名で、お土産もたくさん買いました🍠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はなると金時のお芋巡りもしようと思います…♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05RRNA9JMVJER89FT3Z01","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05SXQGBGP0HFAYSKD0MMM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カッコイイ憧れのハッピです🤩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05TXWZVT0QMSV64B29A37","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05W01AQTKQG1ZSMXM3FTN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"娯茶平50周年記念集もいただきました🙏🙏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また娯茶平の皆さんと一緒に踊れる日が来るように、\nそして自分の阿波おどりを見て、「阿波おどりを見に行ってみたい!自分も踊りたい!」と思ってもらえるように、\n微力ですが…私自身練習を重ね、阿波おどりの魅力を発信していけたらなと思います!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05X3NTMY6YKFYPSSRA728","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"阿波おどり最高です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"娯茶平の皆様、本当にありがとうございました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Instagramに素敵なリールをアップしてくださっているので、よろしければご覧ください🥲\n🎞 https://www.instagram.com/reel/CwiAO0yhzw3/?igshid=MzRlODBiNWFlZA=="},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05Y4TFYRSE06ZMT3JPJR6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ05Z7D1VCSJHTK5A58VR12","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は高円寺の阿波おどりも少し見に行きました~🙊"}],"source":"archive"}